repository-code: "https://github.com/0xferit/manuscript-decentralized-curation"
url: "https://github.com/0xferit/manuscript-decentralized-curation"
abstract: >-
  A working draft thesis on decentralized curation: the trustless
  transformation of raw information into decision-grade knowledge.
  Proposes a general framework and instantiates it on news via bonded
  publication, open challenges, external decentralized dispute
  resolution, and drafted-curator relevance rounds.
keywords:
  - decentralized curation
  - mechanism design
  - trustless systems
  - blockchain
  - information quality
  - knowledge aggregation
  - Schelling point
  - dispute resolution
